{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Waste Time Lotto \u2013 The Odds Are Terrible, but Hope Never Dies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you love games where you can <strong>watch numbers roll in</strong>, hoping that this time, against all odds, you'll hit the jackpot? <strong>Waste Time Lotto</strong> is here just for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf9f\u00a0\u00a0<strong>What\u2019s in store?</strong><br>\u2705 A four-digit lottery that almost never matches!*<br>\u2705 Automated draws at a rapid pace \u2013 because waiting is overrated!<br>\u2705 A never-ending win counter \u2013 no money, just infinite glory and a number that keeps growing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 And while you're waiting... why not press the Useless Click button and enjoy the fully integrated clicker? Totally optional, utterly pointless, oddly satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Feeling lucky? Enter your own lucky number and see if fate is on your side!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc5\u00a0So, what are you waiting for? Come waste some time in the only lottery where the real prize is perseverance!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Approximately 1 to 5 wins every 10 hours</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner\u2019s Luck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3551650/c15cebfb5a142e6da5f5eb50ec9f1f7e2f4d456a.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551650?t=1773257488","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551650?t=1773257488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551650/5f04f674519e6ad47c1a405